      "type": "Skill",
      "name": { "pt-BR": "O Poder da Fofura", "en": "The Power of Cuteness", "zh-CN": "可爱即是正义" },
      "description": {
        "pt-BR": "Concede a um único aliado um Escudo que pode absorver Dano igual a #1[i]% da DEF de 7 de Março + #4[i] por #2[i] rodada(s).\nSe esse aliado tiver #3[i]% ou mais de PV, aumenta significativamente a chance de inimigos atacarem esse aliado.",
        "en": "Provides a single ally with a Shield that can absorb DMG equal to #1[i]% of March 7th's DEF plus #4[i] for #2[i] turn(s).\nIf the ally's current HP percentage is #3[i]% or higher, greatly increases the chance of enemies attacking that ally.",
        "zh-CN": "为指定我方单体提供能够抵消等同于三月七#1[i]%防御力+#4[i]伤害的护盾，持续#2[i]回合。\n若该目标当前生命值百分比大于等于#3[i]%，被敌方攻击的概率大幅提高。"
